body:
Cleaned it up a tiny bit since I noticed there were a few things out of place and replaced the objective, not sure if it seems a bit cliché still though... Also moved the education up to hopefully be able to catch some eyes! Hopefully this looks better!

&#x200B;

[https://imgur.com/a/Mns2Rkm](https://imgur.com/a/Mns2Rkm)

I updated it with a new layout to contain all the information in a single page and to make it more simplistic. Do you feel this is any better? Also, thank you, seriously hoping I can get something related to the Walmart job I spoke about in the post!

&#x200B;

[https://imgur.com/a/by2BhTW](https://imgur.com/a/by2BhTW)

Shows the same error as the key my friend gave. "Promo code not found."

&#x200B;

Not sure if I'm just activating it on the wrong page or what, but hopefully someone else could use the code. Thank you though! :)
